<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>HKAI-PV | RandomForest Predictor</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --bg-deep:      #030d1f;
      --bg-panel:     #061428;
      --bg-card:      #0a1e38;
      --bg-card2:     #0d2444;
      --border:       rgba(0, 168, 255, 0.22);
      --border-glow:  rgba(0, 168, 255, 0.55);
      --accent:       #00a8ff;
      --accent2:      #00e5ff;
      --accent3:      #7b61ff;
      --warn:         #ffd600;
      --danger:       #ff4757;
      --success:      #00e676;
      --text-primary: #e8f4ff;
      --text-sec:     #7ab3d4;
      --text-dim:     #4a7a9b;
      --font: 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
    }

    html, body { width: 100%; height: 100%; background: var(--bg-deep); color: var(--text-primary); font-family: var(--font); overflow: hidden; }
    .app { display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100vh; width: 100vw; }

    .topbar {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 28px; height: 52px;
      background: rgba(6,20,40,0.97);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      flex-shrink: 0; z-index: 10;
    }
    .topbar-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; }
    .catl-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
    .catl-logo-text { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #fff; }
    .catl-logo-sub  { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-sec); letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .logo-divider   { width: 1px; height: 28px; background: var(--border); }
    .system-name-main { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffe066; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .system-name-sub  { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-sec); letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
    .topbar-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .status-badge {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
      padding: 4px 12px; background: rgba(0,229,255,0.07);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,255,0.28); border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 11px; color: var(--accent2);
    }
    .status-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #00e676; animation: pulse 2s infinite; }
    @keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{opacity:1} 50%{opacity:.4} }
    .topbar-tag { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-dim); padding: 3px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; }

    .main { display: flex; flex: 1; overflow: hidden; }

    .left-panel {
      width: 264px; flex-shrink: 0;
      background: var(--bg-panel);
      border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      padding: 16px 0 12px; overflow-y: auto;
    }
    .panel-section-title {
      font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-dim);
      letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 0 16px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .panel-hint {
      font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-dim); padding: 0 16px 10px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
    }
    .hint-dot { width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); animation: pulse 2s infinite; }
    .stage-item {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      padding: 10px 14px; cursor: pointer;
      border-left: 3px solid transparent;
      transition: all 0.2s; position: relative;
    }
    .stage-item:hover { background: rgba(0,168,255,0.05); }
    .stage-item.active { background: rgba(0,168,255,0.08); border-left-color: var(--accent); }
    .stage-color-bar { width: 4px; height: 32px; border-radius: 2px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .stage-icon {
      width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 6px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 16px; flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .stage-info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
    .stage-name { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 2px; }
    .stage-sub  { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-sec); }
    .stage-badge {
      font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent2);
      background: rgba(0,229,255,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,255,0.2);
      border-radius: 8px; padding: 2px 7px; white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .pipeline-card,
    .left-stats,
    .feature-card,
    .metric-card,
    .module-card,
    .detail-card,
    .rf-note,
    .selected-panel,
    .cluster-legend,
    .loading-overlay,
    .radar-card,
    .candidate-item,
    .agent-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .pipeline-card { margin: 10px 14px 0; overflow: hidden; }
    .pipeline-title {
      font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-dim); letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      padding: 8px 12px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .pipeline-steps { padding: 10px 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; }
    .pipeline-step { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-start; }
    .pipeline-step-num {
      width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255,224,102,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(255,224,102,0.28);
      color: #ffe066; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .pipeline-step-body { flex: 1; }
    .pipeline-step-name { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-primary); }
    .pipeline-step-sub { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-sec); margin-top: 2px; line-height: 1.45; }

    .left-stats { margin: 10px 14px 0; padding: 10px 12px; }
    .stat-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 4px 0; }
    .stat-row + .stat-row { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
    .stat-label { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-dim); }
    .stat-value { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent2); }

    .center-panel { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
    .viz-header {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 10px 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .viz-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-primary); }
    .viz-subtitle { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-sec); margin-top: 1px; }
    .viz-controls { display: flex; gap: 7px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .ctrl-btn {
      padding: 4px 11px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-sec);
      background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px;
      cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .ctrl-btn:hover, .ctrl-btn.active { color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); background: rgba(0,168,255,0.08); }
    .viz-wrap { flex: 1; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .canvas-bg {
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(0,168,255,0.03) 0%, transparent 70%);
    }
    .canvas-grid {
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(0,168,255,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,168,255,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 48px 48px; pointer-events: none;
    }
    #mainCanvas { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; cursor: crosshair; }

    .right-overlay {
      position: absolute; right: 14px; top: 12px;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
      max-height: calc(100% - 24px); overflow-y: auto;
    }
    .right-overlay::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .cluster-legend {
      background: rgba(6,20,40,0.88); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 13px; backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      min-width: 176px;
    }
    .cl-title { font-size: 9px; color: var(--text-dim); letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 7px; }
    .cl-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .cl-dot { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .cl-label { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-sec); }
    .cl-count { font-size: 9px; color: var(--text-dim); margin-left: auto; }

    .selected-panel {
      background: rgba(6,20,40,0.92);
      padding: 12px 14px; backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      width: 200px; display: none;
    }
    .selected-panel.visible { display: block; }
    .sp-title { font-size: 9px; color: var(--text-dim); letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .sp-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffe066; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .sp-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 4px 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); gap: 10px; }
    .sp-row.multiline { align-items: flex-start; }
    .sp-key { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-dim); }
    .sp-val { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-primary); text-align: right; max-width: 150px; word-break: break-word; }
    .sp-row.multiline .sp-val { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; text-align: left; line-height: 1.45; }

    .zoom-controls {
      position: absolute; right: 14px; bottom: 14px;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;
    }
    .zoom-btn {
      width: 28px; height: 28px; background: var(--bg-card2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 5px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-sec); cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.15s;
    }
    .zoom-btn:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

    .loading-overlay {
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: rgba(3,13,31,0.85);
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      z-index: 50; transition: opacity .4s;
    }
    .loading-overlay.hidden { opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }
    .loading-spinner { width: 36px; height: 36px; border: 3px solid var(--border); border-top-color: #ffe066; border-radius: 50%; animation: spin .8s linear infinite; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    @keyframes spin { to{transform:rotate(360deg)} }
    .loading-text { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-sec); }
    .loading-sub { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-dim); margin-top: 4px; }

    .right-panel {
      width: 268px; flex-shrink: 0;
      background: var(--bg-panel);
      border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      padding: 14px; gap: 12px; overflow-y: auto;
    }
    .rp-section-title {
      font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-dim);
      letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 7px;
    }
    .metric-card { padding: 10px 12px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .metric-label { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 2px; }
    .metric-value { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffe066; line-height: 1; }
    .metric-unit { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-sec); margin-left: 2px; }
    .metric-sub { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-sec); margin-top: 4px; }
    .metric-good { color: var(--success); }
    .metric-warn { color: var(--warn); }

    .module-card { padding: 10px 12px; }
    .module-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .module-name { width: 86px; font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-sec); }
    .module-bar-wrap { flex: 1; height: 7px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; }
    .module-bar { height: 100%; border-radius: 3px; }
    .module-val { width: 42px; text-align: right; font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-primary); }

    .feature-card { padding: 10px 12px; }
    .feature-item {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      padding: 6px 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 6px; cursor: pointer; transition: border-color .2s, transform .2s;
    }
    .feature-item:hover, .feature-item.active { border-color: var(--border-glow); transform: translateX(2px); }
    .feature-rank { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-dim); width: 22px; }
    .feature-name { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
    .feature-title {
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-primary);
      white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    .feature-sub {
      font-size: 9px; color: var(--text-sec); margin-top: 2px;
      white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .feature-score { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffe066; }

    .bottom-panel {
      height: 148px; flex-shrink: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--bg-panel);
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      padding: 9px 18px; gap: 7px;
    }
    .agent-header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; }
    .agent-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
    .agent-avatar {
      width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #b06a00, #ffe066);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #030d1f; flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .agent-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffe066; }
    .agent-status { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-dim); }
    .agent-thinking { display: none; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-sec); }
    .agent-thinking.visible { display: flex; }
    .think-dots span { display: inline-block; width: 4px; height: 4px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ffe066; animation: bounce 1.2s infinite; }
    .think-dots span:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .2s; }
    .think-dots span:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .4s; }
    @keyframes bounce { 0%,80%,100%{transform:translateY(0);opacity:.4} 40%{transform:translateY(-4px);opacity:1} }
    .preset-prompts { display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .preset-btn {
      padding: 4px 10px; background: rgba(255,224,102,0.06);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,224,102,0.2); border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-sec); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .preset-btn:hover { background: rgba(255,224,102,0.13); border-color: #ffe066; color: #ffe066; }
    .chat-messages { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; }
    .chat-msg { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; animation: fadeIn .3s ease; }
    @keyframes fadeIn { from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(3px)} to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)} }
    .msg-role { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }
    .msg-role.user { color: var(--accent); }
    .msg-role.agent { color: #ffe066; }
    .msg-text { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-primary); line-height: 1.5; }
    .msg-text .hl { color: #ffe066; font-weight: 700; }
    .msg-text .tag { display: inline-block; padding: 1px 6px; background: rgba(255,224,102,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255,224,102,0.3); border-radius: 3px; font-size: 10px; color: #ffe066; margin: 0 2px; }
    .msg-text .btag { display: inline-block; padding: 1px 6px; background: rgba(0,168,255,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(0,168,255,0.3); border-radius: 3px; font-size: 10px; color: var(--accent); margin: 0 2px; }
    .chat-input-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
    .chat-input-wrap {
      flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center;
      background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 7px; padding: 0 12px;
      transition: border-color .2s;
    }
    .chat-input-wrap:focus-within { border-color: #ffe066; }
    .chat-input { flex: 1; background: transparent; border: none; outline: none; color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 12px; font-family: var(--font); padding: 7px 0; }
    .chat-input::placeholder { color: var(--text-dim); }
    .send-btn { padding: 7px 16px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #b06a00, #ffe066); border: none; border-radius: 7px; color: #030d1f; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; transition: opacity .2s; white-space: nowrap; }
    .send-btn:hover { opacity: .85; }

    ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; height: 4px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--border); border-radius: 2px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: var(--accent); }

    @media (max-width: 1180px) {
      .left-panel { width: 236px; }
      .right-panel { width: 244px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      html, body { overflow: auto; }
      .app { height: auto; min-height: 100vh; }
      .main { flex-direction: column; overflow: visible; }
      .left-panel, .right-panel { width: 100%; border: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
      .right-panel { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
      .center-panel { min-height: 620px; }
      .bottom-panel { height: auto; min-height: 180px; }
      .topbar { height: auto; padding: 14px 18px; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .topbar-right { flex-wrap: wrap; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-left">
      <div class="catl-logo">
        <svg width="52" height="20" viewBox="0 0 52 20" fill="none">
          <text x="0" y="15" font-family="Arial Black,sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="900" fill="#fff" letter-spacing="1">CATL</text>
        </svg>
        <div>
          <div class="catl-logo-text">宁德时代</div>
          <div class="catl-logo-sub">CATL · AI for Science</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="logo-divider"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="system-name-main">HKAI-PV</div>
        <div class="system-name-sub">随机森林钙钛矿钝化剂性能预测界面</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="topbar-right">
      <div class="status-badge"><div class="status-dot"></div>Model Ready</div>
      <div class="topbar-tag">RandomForest 回归</div>
      <div class="topbar-tag">Seed = 49</div>
      <div class="topbar-tag" id="viewTag">预测散点</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="main">
    <aside class="left-panel">
      <div class="panel-section-title">建模流程</div>
      <div class="panel-hint"><div class="hint-dot"></div>点击左侧步骤切换页面说明</div>

      <div id="stageList"></div>

      <div class="pipeline-card">
        <div class="pipeline-title">特征拼接逻辑</div>
        <div class="pipeline-steps">
          <div class="pipeline-step">
            <div class="pipeline-step-num">1</div>
            <div class="pipeline-step-body">
              <div class="pipeline-step-name">Uni-Mol Embedding</div>
              <div class="pipeline-step-sub">分子结构由 Uni-Mol 编码为 512 维语义向量。</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pipeline-step">
            <div class="pipeline-step-num">2</div>
            <div class="pipeline-step-body">
              <div class="pipeline-step-name">DMPNN Embedding</div>
              <div class="pipeline-step-sub">图神经网络表征钝化剂分子图，取映射后嵌入。</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pipeline-step">
            <div class="pipeline-step-num">3</div>
            <div class="pipeline-step-body">
              <div class="pipeline-step-name">Composition Vector</div>
              <div class="pipeline-step-sub">钙钛矿化学式转为 13 维组分向量，对应 Cs, FA, MA, Rb, DMA, GUA, Pb, Sn, Ge, I, Br, Cl, F。</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pipeline-step">
            <div class="pipeline-step-num">4</div>
            <div class="pipeline-step-body">
              <div class="pipeline-step-name">Control PCE</div>
              <div class="pipeline-step-sub">加入未添加钝化剂时的基线 PCE，用作器件起点信息。</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="left-stats">
        <div class="panel-section-title" style="padding:0 0 6px;border:none;margin:0 0 6px;">实验设置</div>
        <div class="stat-row"><span class="stat-label">分割随机种子</span><span class="stat-value">49</span></div>
        <div class="stat-row"><span class="stat-label">训练集样本</span><span class="stat-value">248</span></div>
        <div class="stat-row"><span class="stat-label">测试集样本</span><span class="stat-value">63</span></div>
        <div class="stat-row"><span class="stat-label">输入特征总维数</span><span class="stat-value">1040+</span></div>
        <div class="stat-row"><span class="stat-label">展示重要特征</span><span class="stat-value">Top 19</span></div>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <main class="center-panel">
      <div class="viz-header">
        <div>
          <div class="viz-title" id="vizTitle">RandomForest 预测性能总览</div>
          <div class="viz-subtitle" id="vizSub">基于 notebook 数据处理逻辑构建的建模页面，展示随机森林性能面板与特征重要性</div>
        </div>
